<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Telecom drops on profit taking.</title>
<headline>Portugal Telecom drops on profit taking.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal Telecom shares fell some three percent on Lisbon bourse on profit taking after recent sharp gains, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Today's correction by PT is natural profit taking after the strong rises in the stock and a downwards adjustment of the stock in New York,&quot; a dealer said.</p>
<p>He added: &quot;PT is likely to oscillate in a range between 6,100 and 6,200 escudos today.&quot;</p>
<p>PT fell to 6,101 escudos before recovering to stand at 6,155 escudos, down 115, in volume of 126,894 at 1214 GMT.</p>
